  "message": "<article class=\"wotd-card\">\n  <header class=\"wotd-header\">\n    <h1 class=\"wotd-word\">eloquent</h1>\n    <div class=\"wotd-pronunciation\">\n      <button class=\"tts-button\" data-wotd-tts=\"eloquent\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\">\n        🔊\n      </button>\n      <span class=\"pronunciation-text\">/ˈel.ə.kwənt/</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"wotd-pos\">adjective</span>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"wotd-meaning\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">뜻</h2>\n    <div class=\"meaning-ko\">웅변의, 능변의, 설득력 있는</div>\n    <div class=\"meaning-en\">fluent or persuasive in speaking or writing</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wotd-examples\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">예문</h2>\n    \n    <div class=\"wotd-example\">\n      <div class=\"example-number\">1</div>\n      <div class=\"example-text\">\n        <div class=\"example-en\">She gave an eloquent speech about climate change.</div>\n        <div class=\"example-ko\">그녀는 기후 변화에 대해 설득력 있는 연설을 했다.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n\n    <div class=\"wotd-example\">\n      <div class=\"example-number\">2</div>\n      <div class=\"example-text\">\n        <div class=\"example-en\">His eloquent words moved the audience to tears.</div>\n        <div class=\"example-ko\">그의 웅변적인 말이 청중을 눈물짓게 했다.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n\n    <div class=\"wotd-example\">\n      <div class=\"example-number\">3</div>\n      <div class=\"example-text\">\n        <div class=\"example-en\">The lawyer made an eloquent argument in defense of his client.</div>\n        <div class=\"example-ko\">변호사는 의뢰인을 변호하기 위해 설득력 있는 주장을 했다.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wotd-phrases\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">주요 표현</h2>\n    <ul class=\"phrases-list\">\n      \n    <li><strong>eloquent speech</strong> - 웅변적인 연설</li>\n  \n\n    <li><strong>eloquent writer</strong> - 능변의 작가</li>\n  \n\n    <li><strong>eloquent testimony</strong> - 설득력 있는 증언</li>\n  \n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wotd-synonyms\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">유의어</h2>\n    <div class=\"synonyms-container\">\n      <span class=\"synonym-tag\">articulate</span> <span class=\"synonym-tag\">fluent</span> <span class=\"synonym-tag\">persuasive</span> <span class=\"synonym-tag\">expressive</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"wotd-footer\">\n    <p>💡 오늘의 단어를 활용하여 영어 실력을 향상시켜보세요!</p>\n  </footer>\n</article>",
